---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import { ArrowRight, Zap, CheckCircle2, AlertOctagon } from 'lucide-react';

const title = 'Self-Healing Training Engine — MoroAI Architecture';
const description = 'How the 5-step autonomous OOM recovery engine and loss divergence rollback keep training runs alive.';
---

<DocsLayout title={title} description={description} currentSlug="/docs/concepts/training-engine/">
  <div class="not-prose mb-8">
    <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-moro-400 uppercase tracking-wider bg-moro-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 rounded border border-moro-500/20 mb-3 inline-block">
      Subsystem 04
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">Self-Healing Training Engine</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-base mt-2">
      Zero-loss training recovery that intercepts CUDA out-of-memory errors and loss explosions automatically.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>The 5-Step Healer Protocol</h2>
  <p>
    When hardware thresholds are violated during backpropagation, MoroAI executes an automated progressive mitigation protocol:
  </p>

  <div class="space-y-4 not-prose my-6 text-sm">
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-dark-950 border border-dark-800">
      <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold font-mono block mb-1">Level 1: Memory Pool Evacuation</span>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Invokes <code>torch.cuda.empty_cache()</code> and forces Python garbage collection to eliminate fragmented blocks.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-dark-950 border border-dark-800">
      <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold font-mono block mb-1">Level 2: Dynamic Micro-Batch Resizing</span>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Divides micro-batch size by 2 while doubling gradient accumulation steps, preserving the exact mathematical gradient trajectory.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-dark-950 border border-dark-800">
      <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold font-mono block mb-1">Level 3: Full Gradient Checkpointing</span>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Enables activation recomputation across all attention and MLP layers, trading ~20% compute time for 60% activation memory reduction.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-dark-950 border border-dark-800">
      <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold font-mono block mb-1">Level 4: Dynamic Sequence Clamping</span>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Detects batch outlier tokens causing burst spikes and clamps the maximum context length for that specific batch.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-dark-950 border border-dark-800">
      <span class="text-purple-400 font-bold font-mono block mb-1">Level 5: Checkpoint Rollback on Loss Divergence</span>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">If moving loss jumps by >3x due to numerical instability, MoroAI rolls back to the last valid checkpoint and reduces learning rate by 20%.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="not-prose mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-dark-800 flex items-center justify-between">
    <a href="/docs/concepts/recipe-engine/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors">
      ← Hardware Recipe Engine
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/concepts/eval-harness/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-moro-500 hover:bg-moro-400 text-white font-semibold text-xs transition-colors">
      <span>Multi-Layer Eval Harness</span>
      <ArrowRight class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
    </a>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
